ODW9501 `Salespersons` is the relation table of this Many2many, not its label; pass the label as `string="Salespersons"`
  --> m2m_relation_is_label.py:8:46
   |
 7 |     # The label lands where the relation table goes: capitals give it away.
 8 |     user_ids = fields.Many2many("res.users", "Salespersons", domain="[('share', '=', False)]")
   |                                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 9 |
10 |     # Same, with a value that could not be a table name at all.
   |

ODW9501 `Finished Lot/Serial` is the relation table of this Many2many, not its label; pass the label as `string="Finished Lot/Serial"`
